---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

---

<PageLayout
  title="Sweat it out: A Khao Sok National Park Weather guide!"
  description="Unravel the Khao Sok weather and the Khao Sok national park weather. Prepare yourself for the Khao Sok the rainy season."
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/DSCF2577.jpg"
  heroTitle="Sweat it out: A Khao Sok National Park Weather guide!"
  heroSubtitle="The Ancient Rainforest of Southern Thailand"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Khao Sok Weather", "href": "/khao-sok-weather/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Life here revolves around the Khao Sok rainy season, which effects many parts of daily life. Therefore, before you book your ticket, I recommend doing a bit of research. We're here to help you understand the Khao Sok weather. Khao Sok national park weather can effect your options.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/DSCF2577.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok National Park Weather"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok National Park Weather</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Officially, we can divide <a href="/faq-items/when-is-the-best-time-to-visit-khao-sok-national-park/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Khao Sok weather into three seasons</a>:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>The Hot Season, from March to May</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>The Monsoon Season (Khao Sok rainy season), from June to October</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>The Dry Season, from November to February (<a href="/khao-sok-dry-season/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Read our guide to Khao Sok Dry season</a>)</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          However, the weather conditions closely effect life here so we have divided the year into two clear seasons. Below, you will find information on the Monsoon season, and the non-Monsoon season!
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          They both have their pros and cons and we hope to help you decide the best time to visit Khao Sok national park.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok national park weather – The monsoon</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Monsoon season begins properly in June and the rains reach a peak in August/September. They fade out slowly from November to December.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          During the Khao Sok rainy season, visitors can expect at least one heavy rainfall every day. Beautiful blue skies and sunshine usually follow this!
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          In some extreme cases, rain may fall nonstop for several days. This can be inconvenient, but it doesn't mean you can't still have a great time.. You can still enjoy plenty of <a href="/khao-sok-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">activities</a> in the rain!
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/IMG_2713-FB-518.jpg"
            alt="Rain on the lake"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Rain on the lake</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          While this Khao Sok weather can sound off-putting, the monsoon season does have its charms! On the <a href="/khao-sok-river-tubing/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Sok River</a> activities are sensational during this period. River <a href="/khao-sok-canoe-trip-sabai-sabai/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">canoeing</a> is more exciting than any other time of year, and tubing is a true adventure! Also, the monsoon doesn’t affect cultural activities, such as our <a href="/khao-sok-jungle-cooking/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">jungle cooking</a> or <a href="/khao-sok-elephant-sanctuary/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">the elephant sanctuary.</a>
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/DSC00974.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok weather green season"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok weather green season</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>The Green Season</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Additionally, the Khao Sok rainy season is also the ‘green season’, when the jungle is at its most verdant. Flowers are in bloom, everything is happy and green, and the <a href="/khao-sok-jungle-thailand-rainforest/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">forest</a> exudes health and vibrancy. This is the type of Khao Sok weather that triggers mating rituals among many different animals, especially frogs! The nightly serenade of amorous frogs along the river bank and in the forest will delight guests.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Finally, monsoon season signals the arrival of many of Thailand’s famed fruits! Seasonal fruits, such as Durian, Mangosteen, Longan and Dragon Fruit are only available during this time of year. This alone is a good reason to visit at this time. You can't beat sitting on a balcony in the jungle, eating kilograms of amazing fruit, and watching the rain!
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Monsoon in the jungle – the downsides</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Of course, this Khao Sok national park weather does have its downsides, most notably in how it affects some types of tours. For example, guests planning to visit should be aware that there is no <a href="/kao-sok-national-park-camping/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">jungle camping during monsoon season</a>. Additionally, trips to <a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Cheow Larn </a>Lake often face disruptions.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The authorities close the famous <a href="/khao-sok-cave-exploring-the-crystal-chamber/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">NamTaLoo cave</a> by the lake during the monsoon. The viewpoint hike is also not accessible.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Finally, it is not a good time to view wildlife. As a result of the rains, most large mammals are able to find food and water easily in the deep jungle. Therefore, they do not venture into areas where we can see them.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          In contrast to other Khao Sok resorts, rainy season at the Riverside Cottages is truly magical. Guests can enjoy the rain in a lovely natural setting. This makes the sights, sounds, and smells of the season even better!
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The rain makes a rhythmic sound on the leaves. The air smells sweet because of blooming flowers. Together, they create a special beauty in the forest. Guests can marvel at the strong power of the monsoon floods from the safety and comfort of our Riverside restaurant!
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/IMG_1362.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok National Park weather at Riverside Cottages"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok National Park weather at Riverside Cottages</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok national park weather – The Dry Season</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Dry season in the Khao Sok jungle village begins properly in January, although lighter rains are still possible. By mid-April, the forest is dry and brown, and the river is sluggish and shallow. This is the hottest time of year, when breezes are scarce, and only shade and the river provide natural cooling.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Similar to monsoon season, the dry season also has its pros and cons also. For example, this is the time of year to organise the deep-jungle camping trip of a lifetime! Khao Sok Lake is best during the dry season. You can enjoy beautiful views and many <a href="/khao-sok-trekking-hiking/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">trekking</a> options.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          You can <a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">find more information on our Khao Sok Lake tour packages</a> here. Finally, the lack of food and water in the forest means that wildlife needs to come closer to our resort. As a result, the dry season is the best time of year to view wild Elephants and Gaur, and other large mammals.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/mirroring-the-wild-at-Chiew-Larn-Lake.jpg"
            alt="Thai Elephant"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Thai Elephant</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Unlike monsoon season, the dry season will not heavily impact activities. The main exception is <a href="/khao-sok-river-tubing/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">River Tubing</a>, which isn’t as much fun on a slow-flowing river.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          However, guests will need to prepare themselves for the heat at this time of year. The most useful preparation guests can make is to simply mentally prepare for being hot and sweaty. And of course, be prepared to drink plenty of water!
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/IMG_0433.jpg"
            alt="Khao sok jungle village canoe"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao sok jungle village canoe</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok Weather: Riverside Cottages in the dry season</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          The best place to enjoy the hot and dry Khao Sok weather of the season is in the forest. Under a dense canopy of leaves, bungalows stay cool in the shade.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Finally, our spacious grounds mean that cabins are not crowded together. This gives peace and tranquility to guests, and provides space for cooling breezes to flow freely. This translates to a cooler, more comfortable place to spend those hot days!
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/DSC00100.jpg"
            alt="This way to the river beach"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">This way to the river beach</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Other things to keep in mind</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Besides the seasonal changes in Khao Sok National Park's weather, visitors should note that tourist numbers increase during holidays. The Asian tourists that make up most of this traffic bypass the jungle, and go straight to Khao Sok Lake. As a result, it can be difficult to find a raft house available or tranquility at the lake during these times. The three largest tourist holidays celebrated at the Lake are:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Chinese New Year. The next celebration begins February 5, 2019</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Thai New Year. The next celebration begins April 13, 2019</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span>Western New Year</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Thai and Chinese New year depend on the lunar calendar for the exact starting dates. Therefore, the date on the western calendar will change from year to year. For more information on these festivals, we recommend <a href="https://www.timeanddate.com/holidays/thailand/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">TimeandDate.com</a>.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/Insta-25-FB-618.jpg"
            alt="a trip on the lake"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">a trip on the lake</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We hope that this blog will serve as a useful introduction to Khao Sok national park weather! For further questions, be feel free to send us an email!
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Check out our popular blog, "<a href="/top-6-activities-in-khao-sok/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Top 6 Activities in Khao Sok National Park</a>." It has details on our favorite Khao Sok adventures!
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Find your perfect <a href="/khao-sok-accommodation/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">place to stay </a>and start planning your next adventure at the tropical paradise we call Home!
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/DSC00310.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok jungle village by the river"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok jungle village by the river</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>

      
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
